00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:11.080
[Xiacheng News]

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:17.710
[Crossword Puzzle]

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:23.590
Come on.

00:20:24.310 --> 00:20:25.240
Try to move.

00:20:26.010 --> 00:20:26.470
Come on.

00:20:30.850 --> 00:20:31.490
Push.

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:32.010
Yes.

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:35.400
Push.

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:41.980
Good.

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:42.740
Good!

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:44.600
Take a rest.

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:48.870
Let's stop here for today.

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:50.980
Doctor.

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:52.980
How much longer will it take

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:54.310
before I can try to walk?

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.640
You're making fast progress.

00:20:57.850 --> 00:20:58.910
Miss Dong told me

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:00.400
not to let you rush things.

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:01.400
Get plenty of rest

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:03.050
so you can recover better.

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:04.350
I'm leaving.

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:26.850
Let's go fishing tomorrow.

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:28.240
We haven't fished in a long time.

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:29.740
And when Mentor comes back,

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:31.080
we can have spicy fish.

00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:33.500
It's raining.

00:21:35.510 --> 00:21:37.110
Will the rain stop tomorrow?

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:49.190
This terrible weather! I...

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:56.160
My good bait is completely wasted.

00:21:56.550 --> 00:21:58.680
It wasn't easy to get this Shilixiang.

00:21:58.770 --> 00:22:00.630
I was planning to catch a big fish.

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:02.370
The weather is bad.

00:22:02.850 --> 00:22:04.200
There's nothing we can do.

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:05.190
I don't think so.

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:06.770
Maybe, with this weather,

00:22:06.770 --> 00:22:08.370
the rain will stop in a while.

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:10.070
Let me feel it.

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:15.100
Young Masters!

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:17.440
Are you going out?

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:18.530
There...

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:20.050
We've had a typhoon these past few days,

00:22:20.050 --> 00:22:21.270
and it'll probably last a few more days.

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:22.670
It's better not to go out.

00:22:24.050 --> 00:22:25.980
-It's all wet.
-This weather is awful.

00:22:25.980 --> 00:22:27.900
Could it be the heavenly ghost
making trouble in Xiacheng?

00:22:27.900 --> 00:22:29.810
I heard that
when the heavenly ghost appears,

00:22:29.810 --> 00:22:31.610
bad things will happen.

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:32.510
Really?

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:38.350
What year is this?

00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:40.280
They still believe this nonsense?

00:22:41.980 --> 00:22:42.610
Shrimpie,

00:22:43.770 --> 00:22:45.170
let's do something else.

00:22:47.400 --> 00:22:48.400
What should we do?

00:23:03.350 --> 00:23:05.440
Now that I suddenly have some free time,

00:23:05.440 --> 00:23:06.700
I don't know what to do.

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:09.800
How about playing chess?

00:23:11.310 --> 00:23:12.770
That's boring.

00:23:14.400 --> 00:23:16.530
Why don't we play something exciting?

00:23:21.440 --> 00:23:22.580
Put me down!

00:23:22.660 --> 00:23:24.460
Zhang Hailou, put me down!

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:26.900
Put me down!

00:23:26.920 --> 00:23:28.000
I won't!

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:30.180
Sit tight, Shrimpie!

00:23:31.610 --> 00:23:32.050
Stop!

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:32.730
Turn right!

00:23:34.940 --> 00:23:35.730
Shrimpie,

00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:37.690
the weather is finally fine.

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:38.550
Let's go sea fishing.

00:23:38.550 --> 00:23:40.080
You call this fine weather?

00:23:40.200 --> 00:23:41.700
I can't go.

00:23:42.240 --> 00:23:43.480
Isn't the boat right there?

00:23:43.480 --> 00:23:44.540
Just bring it over.

00:23:44.810 --> 00:23:45.770
The sea is too rough.

00:23:45.770 --> 00:23:47.110
We can't go out to sea.

00:23:47.270 --> 00:23:48.500
I'll pay you more.

00:23:49.090 --> 00:23:50.570
It's not about money.

00:23:51.010 --> 00:23:52.230
Why can't we go?

00:23:52.850 --> 00:23:54.240
The sea is too rough.

00:23:54.240 --> 00:23:56.770
-I'll double it, okay?
-Still dreaming things can be like they used to be?

00:23:56.770 --> 00:23:58.360
Why can't I make you understand?

00:23:58.360 --> 00:23:59.740
These waves aren't dangerous at all.

00:23:59.740 --> 00:24:01.940
You're just a burden now.

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:02.940
Figure it out yourself.

00:24:02.940 --> 00:24:04.620
Why can't I reason with you?

00:24:05.400 --> 00:24:06.240
If you want to go so badly,

00:24:06.240 --> 00:24:08.100
find someone else to take you. Go.

00:24:08.810 --> 00:24:11.300
Trash shouldn't be alive.

00:24:11.550 --> 00:24:12.540
Like I care!

00:24:14.350 --> 00:24:15.310
Don't hold me up.
I need to haul in the net and go home.

00:24:15.310 --> 00:24:16.640
Stop fooling yourself.

00:24:25.670 --> 00:24:26.930
[Excessive use of strychnine may lead to madness;
physicians should prescribe with utmost caution.]

00:24:27.040 --> 00:24:29.180
[Long-term use
may lead to personality changes.]

00:24:30.470 --> 00:24:32.070
What is wrong with me lately?

00:24:32.220 --> 00:24:32.470
[Long-term use
may lead to personality changes.]

00:24:32.680 --> 00:24:34.490
[Pharmacy]

00:24:36.580 --> 00:24:37.420
[Pharmacy]

00:24:42.600 --> 00:24:43.410
Mr. Zhang,

00:24:43.590 --> 00:24:45.810
there is nothing wrong with your health.

00:24:45.810 --> 00:24:47.550
You can stay under observation
for a while.

00:24:47.550 --> 00:24:49.480
Come to me if you have any problems.

00:26:17.790 --> 00:26:18.400
[Award of Commendation]

00:26:48.900 --> 00:26:49.550
Mimi,

00:26:49.590 --> 00:26:50.600
come down!

00:26:55.200 --> 00:26:57.040
Mimi, come down!

00:27:08.270 --> 00:27:09.240
Come down.

00:27:09.810 --> 00:27:10.440
Come down.

00:27:14.320 --> 00:27:14.990
Let me do it.

00:27:18.510 --> 00:27:19.510
Can you?

00:27:37.700 --> 00:27:39.350
Who told you
to throw the stone at the cat?

00:27:39.350 --> 00:27:40.850
You almost killed it!

00:27:40.900 --> 00:27:41.830
-Yuanbao!
-I...

00:27:41.850 --> 00:27:42.530
Come down!

00:27:42.770 --> 00:27:43.570
Come down!

00:27:43.850 --> 00:27:44.590
Are you okay?

00:27:46.310 --> 00:27:47.370
What are you doing?

00:27:48.480 --> 00:27:49.510
I was just trying to help.

00:27:49.510 --> 00:27:50.160
Mother,

00:27:50.270 --> 00:27:51.770
he threw a stone at Mimi!

00:27:51.850 --> 00:27:52.310
I...

00:27:52.310 --> 00:27:52.850
Stop it!

00:27:53.480 --> 00:27:55.810
Doing such a despicable thing at your age!

00:27:55.900 --> 00:27:57.160
Shameless!

00:27:58.930 --> 00:28:00.330
Are you going to explain?

00:28:01.380 --> 00:28:03.440
Will they believe you if you explain?

00:28:07.700 --> 00:28:10.310
No one can even understand
your good intentions,

00:28:10.310 --> 00:28:12.690
let alone believe anything else you say.

00:28:13.400 --> 00:28:15.730
Zhang Hailou and your mentor are the same.

00:28:25.660 --> 00:28:29.400
[No animals were hurt
during the shooting]

00:28:39.400 --> 00:28:40.630
Give me the cat!

00:28:41.660 --> 00:28:42.700
Let me go! You...

00:28:43.350 --> 00:28:44.460
Let go! You're hurting me!

00:28:44.460 --> 00:28:47.320
-Let go of my mother!
-Yuanbao! Come back! Yuanbao!

00:28:47.590 --> 00:28:48.390
Let me go!

00:28:48.550 --> 00:28:49.780
You're hurting me!

00:28:52.850 --> 00:28:53.660
No!

00:28:54.440 --> 00:28:55.810
Let go of my mother!

00:28:59.810 --> 00:29:01.060
Give me the cat!

00:29:01.200 --> 00:29:01.980
Let's go!

00:29:01.980 --> 00:29:03.330
Let's go home! Hurry!

00:29:22.440 --> 00:29:23.270
I...

00:29:34.810 --> 00:29:35.480
Young Master,

00:29:35.480 --> 00:29:37.440
you're awake? Breakfast is ready.

00:30:30.970 --> 00:30:33.190
[Murder]

00:30:33.290 --> 00:30:35.950
[Crossword Puzzle]

00:30:40.290 --> 00:30:41.150
[Murder]

00:30:46.240 --> 00:30:47.680
[Murder]

00:30:49.460 --> 00:30:55.390
[Murder]

00:31:05.090 --> 00:31:06.550
Young Master, the doctor is here.

00:31:06.550 --> 00:31:08.350
He is waiting for you in the room.

00:31:14.050 --> 00:31:14.850
Young Master?

00:31:16.900 --> 00:31:17.830
What's the rush?

00:31:18.900 --> 00:31:19.700
I'm coming.

00:31:26.590 --> 00:31:27.980
Great. Yes.

00:31:28.160 --> 00:31:29.290
Take a step. Come on.

00:31:29.480 --> 00:31:30.360
Be careful.

00:31:31.740 --> 00:31:32.430
Be careful.

00:31:33.010 --> 00:31:34.050
Yes, very good.

00:31:34.850 --> 00:31:35.240
Yes.

00:31:35.940 --> 00:31:36.400
Come on.

00:31:36.850 --> 00:31:37.510
A little more.

00:31:37.510 --> 00:31:37.980
Yes.

00:31:40.640 --> 00:31:41.370
Are you okay?

00:31:43.550 --> 00:31:44.090
Steady.

00:31:45.550 --> 00:31:46.010
Come on.

00:32:03.850 --> 00:32:04.310
Come on.

00:32:05.810 --> 00:32:06.270
Good.

00:32:06.960 --> 00:32:07.690
You can do it.

00:32:13.770 --> 00:32:14.630
Yes, very good.

00:32:14.880 --> 00:32:15.340
Come on.

00:32:15.510 --> 00:32:16.110
Slow down.

00:32:16.160 --> 00:32:17.420
Be careful. Steady.

00:32:23.590 --> 00:32:24.270
Hold on.

00:32:24.330 --> 00:32:25.680
Good. Keep your balance.

00:32:25.680 --> 00:32:26.140
Come on.

00:32:26.510 --> 00:32:26.980
Come on.

00:32:27.310 --> 00:32:28.440
You're doing great.

00:32:29.000 --> 00:32:29.460
Come on.

00:32:29.850 --> 00:32:30.450
Good.

00:32:32.910 --> 00:32:33.440
Good.

00:32:36.670 --> 00:32:37.500
No rush.

00:32:38.180 --> 00:32:39.610
You were being awesome today.

00:32:39.610 --> 00:32:41.870
Let's stop here. I'll get you some water.

00:32:46.010 --> 00:32:47.100
Run!

00:32:52.220 --> 00:32:52.900
Slow down!

00:32:52.900 --> 00:32:53.890
We're taking off!